{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00585","headline":"郊庙歌辞 释奠武成王乐章 迎神 · 于邵","name":"郊庙歌辞 释奠武成王乐章 迎神","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"卜畋不从，兆发非熊。\n乃倾荒政，爰佐一戎。\n盛烈载垂，命祀惟崇。\n日练上戊，宿严閟宫。\n迎奏嘉至，感而遂通。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"于邵","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00585.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00585","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}